	--   RF/Codex/AskRedeemAll            RF/AwayEarnings/AskCollect
	--   RF/Haul/WearBest                 RF/PetSatchel/AskWearBest
	--   RE/PetSatchel/WriteFavourite     RE/PetSatchel/SellSelection
	--   RF/Fusery/LoadPet · BeginFuse · FinishReveal · EjectPet
	--   RF/Treadmill/AskWearStill · AskDoff · AskTierRaise
